  },
  {
    q: 'Why is Antwerp Europe’s chemicals gateway?',
    a: 'Antwerp hosts Europe’s largest petrochemical cluster on a port that moves ≈12.5m TEU (2023), so its chemical, polymer, breakbulk and reefer terminals are denser than a container-first layout. If you ship chemicals or temperature-controlled goods, Antwerp’s specialised infrastructure is the reason to choose it over a container-first port.',
